                  </td>

                  <td class="block lg:table-cell px-6 py-5 align-top">
                    <span class="lg:hidden text-xs font-bold text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wide mb-1 block">Description</span>
                    <input type="text" value="Describe the scope and member responsibilities"
